    <article class="section" id="about-me">
        <div id="about-content">
            <h1 class="animate-scroll" id="about-header"><strong>About Me</strong></h1>
            <p class="animate-scroll" id="about-me-paragraph">
                A results-driven Associate Software Engineer with 2 years of combined experience in designing and developing robust software solutions. 
                Proficient in building scalable microservices using .NET, with expertise in Java from previous roles and personal projects.
                I am an analytical problem solver and skilled engineer.<br /><br />
                Interested in full-stack development and artificial intelligence and motivated by tangible innovation. 
                In addition to my strong technical skills in DotNet, Java, and
                <a id="more-skills" href="#proj-skill">more</a>, my education & experience has allowed me to
                develop my leadership, teamwork, communication, and people management skills.<br /><br />
                With this background, I am confident in my ability to serve as a valuable team player in a software engineering role, 
                and I plan to leverage my combination of people and technical skills in the future as I grow.
            </p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn-arrow" href=#edu-exp id="credentials-button">My Credentials<br />∨</a>
